## 13. Directory Structure

```text
PCB/
├── README.md
├── Schematic/
├── PCB/
├── Gerber/
└── Documentation/
```

The `Schematic/` directory contains the circuit schematic, while the `PCB/` directory contains the EasyEDA PCB layout. Gerber files for manufacturing are stored separately in the `Gerber/` directory.
